  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance: Outcome-based finance for clean cooking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a technical assistance project associated with Project 300539-402 Outcome-based finance for clean cooking. 
This project will explore barriers and enablers to adoption of outcomes-based financing in World Bank Clean Cooking Fund and Sustainable Energy for All, the delivery partners of the &quot;Outcome-based finance for clean cooking&quot; project.
This will include identifying options for outcome metrics and funding modalities in
clean cooking.</narrative>
  </description>
